\"/media/590567a8895b0a9720da0f80cc92f32954b1a2d0.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/4c35375a7b6f7320b9a337ae0633f598adeddc09.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/4ef57745e703d4328658c10a62b91d0654fa1557.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> <p>\n <img src=\"/media/f56fcee8b356b4af5b10c30be6fdee79111fa39f.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p></div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>(b, c)</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/b697fd2e361afb9a98746793416d7b0a0e295847.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":21,"type":"MCQ","correct":"B","right":1,"wrong":0.33,"qtext":"<p>If <img src=\"/media/540ff8332e51bb7e68841897c86708f3da585cf1.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> then the two event <em>A</em> and <em>B</em> are necessarily</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> independent</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> mutually exclusive</div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> dependent</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> equally likely</div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>(b)</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/c989514fc0bfa49488621b0b4d6f12d6196cbbb5.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":22,"type":"MCQ","correct":"C","right":1,"wrong":0.33,"qtext":"<p>A container contains 10 white balls and 15 black balls. Two balls are drawn is successive without replacement. The probability that one of them is black and other is white is</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> 0.2</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> 0.3</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> 0.5</div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> 0.4</div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>(c)</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/a993111720629